{"ordinal":12115,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453579284485","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Ears_DontShoot_01d49b0","source":"Daughter: Мне вот папа тоже запрещает, но не всё же!","target":"Daughter: Și mie tata îmi interzice unele lucruri, dar nu chiar pe toate!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12116,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453579284484","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Ears_DontShoot_0bfa33d","source":"Daughter: Может быть, её мама Гость?","target":"Daughter: Poate mama ei e Musafir?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12117,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453579284483","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Ears_DontShoot_0ac09c3","source":"Daughter: Она много чего ей запрещает.","target":"Daughter: Îi interzice o mulțime de lucruri.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12118,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453579284482","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Ears_DontShoot_05d04e2","source":"Daughter: Ей просто дома тяжело. У неё мама очень строгая.","target":"Daughter: Acasă îi e greu. Mama ei e foarte severă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12119,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453579284481","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Ears_DontShoot_05c499d","source":"Daughter: Но она вообще хорошая.","target":"Daughter: Dar în rest e o fată bună.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12120,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453579284480","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Ears_DontShoot_08f1b5f","source":"Daughter: А потом – бац! – и сделает какую-то пакость!","target":"Daughter: Și apoi, pac!, face vreo poznă!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12121,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453575090183","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Ears_DontShoot_007da24","source":"Daughter: Мы с ней играем, играем.","target":"Daughter: Ne jucăm împreună, ne jucăm…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
