{"ordinal":12124,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453575090180","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Ears_Gun_0f0ac04","source":"Daughter: Вы прям как моя лучшая подружка порой...","target":"Daughter: Uneori semănați tare cu prietena mea cea mai bună…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12125,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453575090179","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Ears_Gun_056edc6","source":"Daughter: Вы что, хотите меня обидеть?","target":"Daughter: Vreți să mă supărați?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12126,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453575090178","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Ears_Gun_022c7ba","source":"Daughter: А об этом тоже расскажу!","target":"Daughter: O să povestesc și despre asta!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
