{"ordinal":12132,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453570895877","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_DontShoot_0dbb10e","source":"Daughter: ...","target":"Daughter: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12133,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453570895876","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_DontShoot_0218b71","source":"Daughter: Папа испугался, а потом они обнялись.","target":"Daughter: Tata s-a speriat, apoi s-au îmbrățișat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12134,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453570895875","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_DontShoot_07cc54b","source":"Daughter: С длинными волосами и в длинном плаще.","target":"Daughter: Cu părul lung și cu o pelerină lungă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12135,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453570895874","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_DontShoot_0996e6a","source":"Daughter: Там в одном месте на нас с папкой какой-то дяденька оружием показал.","target":"Daughter: La un moment dat, un domn a îndreptat o armă spre mine și tata.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12136,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453570895873","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_DontShoot_076ef6d","source":"Daughter: Мы как-то с папкой пошли на рынок.","target":"Daughter: Odată am mers cu tata la piață.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12137,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453570895872","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_DontShoot_0c4efe1","source":"Daughter: Ой, а я вспомнила!","target":"Daughter: Vai, mi-am amintit!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12138,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453566701575","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_DontShoot_0e04875","source":"Daughter: Наверное, нет.","target":"Daughter: Poate că nu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
