{"ordinal":12140,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453566701573","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_Gun_0eb28fe","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12141,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453566701572","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_Gun_0d70c91","source":"Daughter: У вас такое же ружьё, что ли?","target":"Daughter: Aveți și dumneavoastră o pușcă la fel?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12142,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453566701571","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_Gun_0c6c0cf","source":"Daughter: Там у собаки было ружьё, из которого он щёлкал, и получались фотографии!","target":"Daughter: Câinele acela avea o pușcă ce făcea clic și ieșeau fotografii!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12143,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453566701570","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_Gun_04b0c4d","source":"Daughter: Ой, я тут вспомнила, что видела мультик такой!","target":"Daughter: Vai, mi-am amintit că am văzut un desen animat cu asta!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12144,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453566701569","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_083ed22","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12145,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453566701568","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Photo_0d3f1fb","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12146,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453562507270","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Eyes_DontShoot_0ffd110","source":"Daughter: Надеюсь, что сейчас он тоже вернётся. Просто он заблудился где-то. Да...","target":"Daughter: Sper că și acum se va întoarce. Doar s-a rătăcit pe undeva. Da…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12147,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453562507269","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Eyes_DontShoot_07b8ecc","source":"Daughter: Но потом папка нашёлся.","target":"Daughter: Dar apoi tati s-a întors.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12148,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453562507268","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Eyes_DontShoot_026f2ac","source":"Daughter: Я же даже не знала, как домой вернуться, мы же были очень далеко!","target":"Daughter: Nici nu știam cum să mă întorc acasă, eram foarte departe!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12149,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453562507267","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Eyes_DontShoot_0b6d276","source":"Daughter: Я испугалась, что я умру без него!","target":"Daughter: Mi-a fost teamă că o să mor fără el!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12150,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453562507266","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Eyes_DontShoot_029af80","source":"Daughter: Но папа тогда потерялся, куда-то ушёл.","target":"Daughter: Dar atunci tata s-a pierdut, a plecat undeva.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12151,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453562507265","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Eyes_DontShoot_030e054","source":"Daughter: И я так много туда поднималась, что готова была выпить целое море. Нет, океан!","target":"Daughter: Și m-am urcat acolo de atâtea ori, că aș fi băut o mare întreagă. Nu, un ocean!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12152,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453562507264","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Eyes_DontShoot_00afad5","source":"Daughter: И мне даже нисколечко не было страшно! Вот совсем! Это было весело!","target":"Daughter: Și nici măcar un pic nu mi-a fost frică! Deloc! A fost distractiv!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12153,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453558312968","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Eyes_DontShoot_0b6ff57","source":"Daughter: Я таких ещё никогда не видела!","target":"Daughter: Nu mai văzusem niciodată unele ca alea!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12154,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453558312967","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Eyes_DontShoot_0fd688f","source":"Daughter: Там была очень-преочень большущая горка!","target":"Daughter: Acolo era un tobogan foarte, foarte maaare!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12155,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453558312966","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Eyes_DontShoot_0aef2a6","source":"Daughter: Как-то я была на далёкой-далёкой площадке!","target":"Daughter: Odată am fost la un loc de joacă foarte, foarte departe!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-306.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12156,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453558312965","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Eyes_DontShoot_077d851","source":"Daughter: ...","target":"Daughter: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
