{"ordinal":12166,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453554118659","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Hands_DontShoot_06cf86d","source":"Daughter: Папа говорит, что я такой красавицей уродилась в нашу маму!","target":"Daughter: Tata zice că m-am născut frumoasă ca mama!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12167,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453554118658","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Hands_DontShoot_09523f8","source":"Daughter: Прямо как у меня!","target":"Daughter: La fel ca ale mele!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12168,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453554118657","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Hands_DontShoot_06a66f4","source":"Daughter: Ещё у неё платье тоже было очень-очень красивое!","target":"Daughter: Și rochia ei era foarte, foarte frumoasă!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12169,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453554118656","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Hands_DontShoot_0de2a20","source":"Daughter: Помню только, что они красивые были.","target":"Daughter: Îmi amintesc doar că erau frumoase.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12170,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453549924359","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Hands_DontShoot_0d41c27","source":"Daughter: Но я уже плохо их помню.","target":"Daughter: Dar nu mi le mai amintesc prea bine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12171,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453549924358","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Hands_DontShoot_0e952bd","source":"Daughter: Мне очень нравились ногти мамы.","target":"Daughter: Îmi plăceau foarte mult unghiile mamei.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12172,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453549924357","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Hands_Gun_0dcea17","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12173,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453549924356","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Hands_Gun_067ffb8","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12174,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453549924355","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Hands_Gun_01348f5","source":"Daughter: Я же показала вам свои ноготочки!..","target":"Daughter: V-am arătat deja unghiuțele mele!..","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12175,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453549924354","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Hands_Gun_08c83ee","source":"Daughter: Можете, пожалуйста, не пугать меня так!","target":"Daughter: Puteți, vă rog, să nu mă mai speriați așa?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12176,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453549924353","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Hands_Gun_0b6ccca","source":"Daughter: Мне не нравится эта игра...","target":"Daughter: Nu-mi place jocul ăsta…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
