{"ordinal":12179,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453545730054","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_035cfe0","source":"Daughter: ...","target":"Daughter: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12180,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453545730053","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_0e56072","source":"Daughter: А у меня и ничего ценного нет, чтобы спрятать...","target":"Daughter: Dar eu nici n-am ceva de preț de ascuns…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12181,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453545730052","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_0580ab4","source":"Daughter: ...","target":"Daughter: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12182,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453545730051","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_06dd786","source":"Daughter: А я ж клад не успела спрятать!","target":"Daughter: Dar n-am apucat să ascund comoara!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12183,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453545730050","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_04763cd","source":"Daughter: Ой...","target":"Daughter: Vai…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12184,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453545730049","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_0c4d326","source":"Daughter: Вы тоже с ним играли в эту игру, когда были маленькими, а теперь со мной играете?","target":"Daughter: Și dumneavoastră vă jucați jocul ăsta cu el când erați mici, iar acum vă jucați cu mine?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12185,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453545730048","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_00290cc","source":"Daughter: Ой, я вспомнила! Она вроде называется казаки-разбойники!","target":"Daughter: Vai, mi-am amintit! Parcă se numește „Cazaci și tâlhari”!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12186,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453541535751","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_0e59804","source":"Daughter: Только папа говорил, что они пользовались палочками.","target":"Daughter: Doar că tata spunea că ei foloseau bețe.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12187,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453541535750","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_048a97b","source":"Daughter: И все они там ходят с оружием!","target":"Daughter: Și toți de acolo umblă cu arme!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12188,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453541535749","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_0b6af69","source":"Daughter: А другие должны победить всех первых или найти клад.","target":"Daughter: Iar ceilalți trebuie să-i învingă pe toți primii sau să găsească comoara.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12189,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453541535748","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_0e72c3f","source":"Daughter: А потом одна команда прячет клад, а ещё рисует тюрьму, куда потом из другой команды будет кого-то вести.","target":"Daughter: Apoi o echipă ascunde comoara și desenează o închisoare, unde o să ducă pe cineva din cealaltă echipă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12190,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453541535747","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_077988a","source":"Daughter: Там, в общем, делатся на две команды.","target":"Daughter: Acolo se împart în două echipe.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12191,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453541535746","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_DontShoot_04b0b95","source":"Daughter: Папа мне как-то рассказывал про игру такую!","target":"Daughter: Tata mi-a povestit odată despre jocul ăsta!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12192,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453541535745","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_Gun_0ae429e","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12193,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453541535744","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_Gun_0bd328c","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12194,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453537341447","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_Gun_0d7ee81","source":"Daughter: Правда, я не знаю, что это за игра такая!","target":"Daughter: Dar eu nu știu, de fapt, ce fel de joc e!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12195,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453537341446","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_Gun_0fe71f3","source":"Daughter: Вы победили!","target":"Daughter: Ați câștigat!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12196,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453537341445","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Teeth_Gun_0639080","source":"Daughter: Я сдаюсь, сдаюсь!","target":"Daughter: Mă predau, mă predau!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-307.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
